  "richContent": "<p> 仓位 &amp; 收益率</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【150】仓位变动 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A：44.04% → 43.36% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>H：9.46% → 9.42% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A+H：53.50% → 52.78% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>股：56.24% → 55.52% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>债：14.40% → 14.38% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>现金：29.36% → 30.10% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>-- </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>价值（红利）：12.20% → 11.65% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>昨天（2026/06/05）是150 “大建仓”以来，（之前是2026/05/15），A股仓位最低、A+H仓位最低、权益类仓位也最低的日子；  </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>近月国内债券仓位逐步抬升，已渐大于港股仓位。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【S】仓位变动 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A：63.43% → 62.20% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>H：13.30% → 13.23% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>A+H：76.73% → 75.43% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>股：80.73% → 79.51% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>债：13.68% → 14.86% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>现金：5.59% → 5.63% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>-- </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>价值（红利）：18.10% → 16.79% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>国内债券：8.22% → 9.36% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>（国内）纯债：6.69% → 7.84% </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/44B88909-0390-4B8E-86F4-ED73F29DBD6E.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/1F54FB03-4F24-471F-83AB-6FEE8487F028.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/5C148A92-6ED4-4A11-8AB9-19467A145DBB.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/25AF33B5-E9D3-443D-BD7B-BCF0BFC1BADD.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/D9AF8070-E709-4A14-A9DA-864A97B74996.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/8CDA279B-095B-485F-9FAD-C9E1432C0543.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/4C9350D6-0626-4498-ADAA-859338EA20FC.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/BBC3D033-268B-4514-AF61-03D12DE339F8.png\" />",
